{"id":"2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an","date":"2026-10-20","topic":"apps","region":"americas","headline":"YouTube Began as an Online Dating Site","source":{"name":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_YouTube"},"accent":"au","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"Three friends started a new internet site in February 2005.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t1-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":5.38,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":5.84,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.8,1.32,1.6,1.86,2.32,2.82,3.12,3.52]},{"text":"They wanted single people to find dates on this site.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":3.11,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":5.35,"times":[0.0,0.02,0.26,0.68,1.22,1.48,1.74,2.06,2.36,2.5]},{"text":"Almost nobody put dating videos on the new site.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t1-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.27,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":4.27,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.68,1.28,1.56,2.06,2.36,2.48,2.66]},{"text":"So the creators changed the plan for all videos.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t1-3.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.45,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":4.93,"times":[0.0,0.14,0.4,0.78,1.22,1.66,1.88,2.26,2.56]},{"text":"Jawed Karim put the first video at a zoo.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t1-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":3.53,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":4.3,"times":[0.0,0.36,0.74,1.1,1.26,1.62,2.06,2.46,2.56]}],"bands":{"core1000":79,"core1800":9,"ngsl":0,"tsl":5,"nawl":0,"beyond":7},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"wanted single people to find","title":"Verb Object To-Infinitive Pattern","note":"This pattern shows that you want someone else to perform an action. Here, 'wanted' is followed by the person ('single people') and the action ('to find')."},{"i":2,"focus":"Almost nobody","title":"Indefinite Pronoun as Subject","note":"'Nobody' means no person, and 'almost' modifies it to mean hardly anyone. It functions as a singular subject in the sentence."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"Three former PayPal workers created YouTube in February 2005.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t2-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","M","M","M"],"dur":5.65,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":5.28,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.8,1.14,1.82,2.4,2.9,3.42,3.82]},{"text":"They wanted users to post personal videos to find love.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","C","C","C","C","M","M","M"],"dur":3.59,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":4.71,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.3,0.68,0.96,1.2,1.82,2.28,2.66,2.92]},{"text":"But almost nobody uploaded dating clips to the new website.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t2-2.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.68,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":5.77,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.22,0.72,1.6,1.98,2.36,2.66,2.74,2.9]},{"text":"So the founders changed their idea and allowed any video content.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t2-3.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","O","O","M","V","O","O","O"],"dur":4.02,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":5.01,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.22,0.54,0.9,1.32,1.78,2.2,2.42,2.78,3.18]},{"text":"Jawed Karim shared the first video recorded at a zoo.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.65,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":4.16,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.76,1.16,1.36,1.62,2.08,2.74,3.04,3.12]},{"text":"Google bought the company for 1.65 billion dollars in 2006.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t2-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.66,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":5.45,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.64,0.78,1.12,1.68,2.38,3.08,3.72,3.9]}],"bands":{"core1000":72,"core1800":11,"ngsl":2,"tsl":6,"nawl":0,"beyond":9},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"to find love","title":"Infinitive of Purpose","note":"An infinitive phrase starting with 'to' can express the reason for doing something. Here, it explains why users would post videos."},{"i":4,"focus":"recorded at a zoo","title":"Past Participle Modifying Noun","note":"'Recorded' is a past participle phrase modifying 'the first video'. It functions like a shortened relative clause meaning 'which was recorded at a zoo'."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"In February 2005, three former PayPal workers launched YouTube as an online dating service.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t3-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.31,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":7.82,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.52,2.52,2.86,3.38,3.66,4.38,5.04,5.62,6.28,6.4,6.64,7.24]},{"text":"The founders built a platform, which is an online video site, for romantic clips.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t3-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.33,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":6.97,"times":[0.0,0.04,0.32,0.7,0.84,1.82,1.84,2.02,2.18,2.42,2.9,3.76,3.94,4.44]},{"text":"Under their early slogan, the creators invited single adults to post personal videos.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t3-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","C","C","C","C"],"dur":5.65,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":7.11,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.38,0.68,1.74,1.78,2.04,2.42,3.06,3.54,3.94,4.16,4.78]},{"text":"However, very few users uploaded videos that were meant to find dates.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t3-3.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.54,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":5.09,"times":[0.0,0.66,0.88,1.2,1.68,2.08,2.7,3.0,3.14,3.34,3.52,3.8]},{"text":"Because this initial concept failed, the team opened the service to everyone.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t3-4.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","M","M"],"dur":4.77,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":4.89,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.4,0.7,1.3,2.4,2.42,2.64,3.16,3.32,3.66,3.92]},{"text":"Co-founder Jawed Karim published the first clip at a zoo in April 2005.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t3-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.94,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":6.24,"times":[0.0,0.46,0.96,1.6,2.06,2.28,2.6,2.98,3.26,3.36,3.62,4.04,4.44]},{"text":"Google has owned the popular website since acquiring it for 1.65 billion dollars.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t3-6.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.09,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t3-6.m4a","durJa":5.85,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.6,0.88,1.06,1.34,1.84,2.2,2.64,2.9,3.42,4.06,4.98]}],"bands":{"core1000":68,"core1800":13,"ngsl":4,"tsl":7,"nawl":0,"beyond":8},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"which is an online video site","title":"Non-Defining Relative Clause","note":"This clause uses 'which' to give extra, non-essential details about 'platform'. It is separated by commas from the rest of the sentence."},{"i":4,"focus":"Because this initial concept failed","title":"Adverbial Clause of Reason","note":"The conjunction 'Because' introduces a clause that explains why the action in the main clause happened."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"YouTube was established in February 2005 by three former PayPal employees working in California.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t4-0.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.67,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":8.11,"times":[0.0,0.32,0.84,1.24,1.66,2.02,2.86,3.98,4.3,4.82,5.2,5.98,6.54,6.78]},{"text":"The platform, defined as a video hosting service, was originally intended to serve as a dating website.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t4-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","M","M","M","M","M","M","V","V","V","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":6.98,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":7.56,"times":[0.0,0.38,1.2,1.32,1.86,1.98,2.26,2.72,3.62,3.78,4.24,4.78,5.04,5.32,5.62,5.72,6.02]},{"text":"Under the original slogan \"Tune In, Hook Up,\" users were invited to post personal dating videos.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t4-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","V","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":7.11,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":7.73,"times":[0.0,0.5,0.66,1.02,1.86,2.18,2.82,2.96,3.78,4.02,4.28,4.64,4.92,5.2,5.82,6.18]},{"text":"However, the company received almost no video submissions from individuals seeking romantic matches.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t4-3.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.2,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":6.46,"times":[0.0,0.58,0.7,0.98,1.36,1.86,2.36,2.76,3.28,3.74,4.28,4.7,5.1]},{"text":"Recognizing that the dating concept was unsuccessful, the founders decided to pivot toward general media.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t4-4.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.72,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":7.4,"times":[0.0,0.58,0.82,0.9,1.14,1.74,1.98,3.46,3.5,3.78,4.3,4.56,4.92,5.4,5.9]},{"text":"They broadened the platform so anyone could publish, upload, and view streaming videos online.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t4-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.33,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":7.03,"times":[0.0,0.4,0.86,1.0,1.34,1.82,2.22,2.62,3.4,4.2,4.24,4.48,5.02,5.5]},{"text":"The first video, featuring co-founder Jawed Karim at a zoo, was uploaded in April 2005.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t4-6.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","V","V","M","M","M"],"dur":7.34,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":7.81,"times":[0.0,0.48,0.74,1.44,1.96,2.54,3.04,3.58,3.88,3.94,4.62,4.8,5.2,5.48,5.78]},{"text":"By late 2006, the rapidly growing video enterprise was purchased by Google for 1.65 billion dollars.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t4-7.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.45,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t4-7.m4a","durJa":8.33,"times":[0.0,0.16,0.36,1.26,1.96,2.24,2.78,3.12,3.56,3.98,4.38,4.7,5.04,5.64,6.38,7.3]}],"bands":{"core1000":65,"core1800":12,"ngsl":8,"tsl":7,"nawl":0,"beyond":8},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"was established","title":"Passive Voice Structure","note":"The passive voice places the focus on 'YouTube' receiving the action rather than the creators. The agent is introduced later using 'by'."},{"i":4,"focus":"Recognizing that the dating concept was unsuccessful","title":"Present Participle Clause","note":"This -ing participial clause describes the circumstance or reason leading to the main action performed by 'the founders'."},{"i":5,"focus":"so anyone could publish","title":"Conjunction Expressing Purpose","note":"'So' introduces a purpose clause showing the intended outcome of broadening the platform."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"Long before becoming a global media giant, YouTube was conceived as a niche online dating service in early 2005.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t5-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":9.1,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":9.46,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.54,1.2,1.36,1.66,2.14,3.16,3.5,4.0,4.38,4.86,4.96,5.26,5.72,6.3,7.0,7.3,7.64]},{"text":"Three former PayPal employees, Chad Hurley, Steve Chen, and Jawed Karim, launched the website to facilitate digital matchmaking.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t5-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.89,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":10.93,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.56,0.84,2.5,2.5,3.52,3.52,4.24,4.28,4.62,5.7,5.78,6.08,6.28,6.76,7.06,7.82]},{"text":"Operating under the early slogan \"Tune In, Hook Up,\" the founders encouraged single users to upload video profiles to find romance.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t5-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","C","C","C","C","M","M","M"],"dur":8.73,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":12.81,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.66,0.86,1.1,1.8,2.08,2.7,2.74,3.36,3.6,3.9,4.48,4.92,5.48,5.78,6.02,6.46,7.14,7.54,7.78]},{"text":"However, the initial dating concept failed to gain traction, as virtually no users submitted personal videos describing themselves.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t5-3.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.27,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":10.7,"times":[0.0,0.54,0.66,1.02,1.36,1.98,2.42,2.72,2.9,3.88,4.0,4.28,4.7,5.18,5.62,6.0,6.74,7.2]},{"text":"Realizing that people needed a broader video-sharing space, the founders quickly abandoned the romantic requirement from their platform.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t5-4.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","M","V","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":7.91,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":10.06,"times":[0.0,0.46,0.68,0.88,1.26,1.54,2.01,2.84,3.8,3.88,4.16,4.5,5.26,5.52,5.92,6.5,7.04,7.18]},{"text":"The revamped website welcomed any type of original video content, creating an easy-to-use system for sharing streaming media.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t5-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.57,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t5-5.m4a","durJa":9.08,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.32,1.0,1.3,1.78,2.22,2.38,2.74,3.1,3.98,4.28,4.49,5.32,5.72,5.92,6.24,6.64]},{"text":"On April 23, 2005, Karim uploaded the site's inaugural video, which was recorded at a zoo.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t5-6.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.89,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t5-6.m4a","durJa":9.21,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.34,1.28,2.82,3.06,3.58,3.76,4.14,4.32,5.48,5.58,5.74,6.14,6.38,6.42]},{"text":"That strategic shift transformed the enterprise, leading directly to its acquisition by Google for 1.65 billion dollars in late 2006.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/t5-7.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":10.18,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-apps-youtube-began-as-an/ja/t5-7.m4a","durJa":9.04,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.58,1.3,1.96,2.4,3.34,3.54,3.98,4.34,4.5,4.92,5.2,5.54,6.15,6.92,7.62,8.14,8.4,8.54]}],"bands":{"core1000":61,"core1800":13,"ngsl":11,"tsl":5,"nawl":2,"beyond":8},"grammar":[{"i